sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Bos taurus Gierer–Meinhardt wavelength at 3.137 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 88.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 of the 3.137 µm (log10 = -5.503), age 0 Ma Bos taurus detail-scale loop. R1: the comparison figure now prints the 500 nm predecessor growth rate (sigma = -10.91, stable) and the 20 µm successor count (6.38 wavelengths) on the dispersion panel. R2: a second CC BY-SA 3.0 Fleckvieh cow (Kim Hansen, SHA-256 bda7b80a…) is segmented; foreground fraction 0.805 versus 0.623 on the Hereford calf. R3: GIF frames 0–10 are the activator alone; only the last frame anchors the Hereford photograph (display weight 0.50). CV similarity remains 93.0 on that last frame (640×480, 12 frames). Pearson r of FFT wavelength versus k_star(s) remains 0.99595. Measured peak 3.199 µm versus the 3.137 µm calibration. Equal-diffusion sigma_max = -0.275. Production-off amplitude ratio = 7.5e-5. Chronoseries is still 1/1 at 0 Ma. Overall 88.3/100 (faithfulness 87.6, reproducibility 90.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/bos_taurus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 625165 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 9d2ef31e711e9e3085281c0efbb288f98fd34e9e83c76cf52c2850303d7a3a50 (sha256 9d2ef31e711e9e3085281c0efbb288f98fd34e9e83c76cf52c2850303d7a3a50), spec_fingerprint 1bd532598d76e4217901ac1f70693d09d3246f1a450b96284dbb4a060b3f4f2d. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 1bd532598d76e4217901ac1f70693d09d3246f1a450b96284dbb4a060b3f4f2d; artifact_sha256: 9d2ef31e711e9e3085281c0efbb288f98fd34e9e83c76cf52c2850303d7a3a50; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bos_taurus_turing_wavelength_s0/bos_taurus_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=8f87eb39175f4cd9..., datasets/bos_taurus_turing_wavelength_s0/bos_taurus_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=507f9fe3562f91cd...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) and Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) supply the dispersion relation and the activator–inhibitor kinetics. | Wasmeier et al. (2008) place melanosomes below 1 µm. Murray (1981) is the macroscopic coat claim this slot does not repeat.; reconstructed_in_script: Same calibrated Gierer–Meinhardt integration as pass 1, plus the scale-neighbour annotation, a second segmented Bos taurus voucher, and activator-only growth frames. | Pearson r = 0.99595, RMSE = 0.104 µm, KS = 0.414, two foreground fractions that are not equal to each other or to the simulated occupancy.; transfer_boundary: Neither photograph resolves 3.137 µm. The wavelength is the calibrated k_star, not a ruler on the image. | No predecessor chronospecies is in the slot. The age offset along the series is zero.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the Fleckvieh patches are the 3.137 µm mode. That animal is a second segmentation voucher only. | Does not claim a cryptographic nanopublication. No nanopub profile was present. | Does not claim the sibling Holstein flank model.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.883"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

